# Licensing intent

This repository is public and under a reservation of all rights (see LICENSE).

The intent is to publish Taktus as Fair Source or Source Available before version 1.0.0. The exact
model is not settled; it is tied to the accounting basis
(docs/adr/ADR-0010-accounting.md), which is still being calibrated.

Planned split at the time of release:

- **Control plane** — the chosen Fair Source or Source Available model. Free with the complete
  feature set for non-commercial use; self-hosting unrestricted, no feature gate, no licence key, no
  telemetry.
- **contracts/ and the reference adapters** — licensed more permissively, so that third parties may
  build adapters and pass them on. A contract you are not allowed to implement freely is not a
  contract.

Until the decision is made, no third-party contributions are accepted. An accepted outside
contribution would belong to its author under unclear terms and would bind any later licence change
to their agreement.
